  {
   "title": "Révision espacée",
   "html": "<p>Dis à voix haute, sans regarder la réponse :</p><ol><li>tousser <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 50)</small></li><li>dire que <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 48)</small></li><li>deux fois <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 44)</small></li><li>pantalon <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 37)</small></li></ol><details><summary>Réponses</summary><ol><li><span class=\"lo\">ໄອ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Ǎy</span> · tousser</li><li><span class=\"lo\">ບອກວ່າ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̏ɔk wāa</span> · dire que</li><li><span class=\"lo\">ສອງເທື່ອ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Sɔ̌ɔng thʉ̄a</span> · deux fois</li><li><span class=\"lo\">ໂສ້ງ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Sôong</span> · pantalon</li></ol></details>"
  },
