   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Clara visite un appartement.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຫ້ອງນີ້ມີແອບໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ພະນັກງານ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມີ ມີຫ້ອງນ້ຳນຳ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຄ່າເຊົ່າເດືອນລະເທົ່າໃດ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ພະນັກງານ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສອງລ້ານກີບ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ລວມຄ່າໄຟບໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ພະນັກງານ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ລວມ</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Romanisation (mots nouveaux)</summary><p><span class=\"rom\">Hɔ̂ɔng nȉi míi ɛ̌ɛ bɔ̌ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Míi. Míi hɔ̂ɔng-nȁam nám.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Khāa sāo dʉ̌an lā thāo-dǎy?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Sɔ̌ɔng lȁan kȉip.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Lúam khāa fáy bɔ̌ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ lúam.</span></p></details><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Clara</b> — Cette chambre a la clim ?<br><b>L&#x27;employé</b> — Oui. Et une salle de bain.<br><b>Clara</b> — Le loyer est de combien par mois ?<br><b>L&#x27;employé</b> — Deux millions de kips.<br><b>Clara</b> — Électricité comprise ?<br><b>L&#x27;employé</b> — Non.</p></details>"
